        <h2 class="intro-heading" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/chelsea-domestic-violence.astro:v29azo">Chelsea Domestic Violence Charges Require An Experienced, Established, and Capable Defense. We Defend These Charges:</h2>
        <img
